## SECTION 6 — RISK FLAGS

**[FLAG 1] CPF OA unverified.** ~$270,000 needed from CPF OA. If short, cash covers the gap — but that erodes the $147,400 buffer. Confirm balance before OTP.

**[FLAG 2] Tenure at hard age cap.** 30yr tenure assumes borrower is exactly 35. One year older = 29yr tenure = higher monthly payment. Confirm exact age.

**[FLAG 3] Day-one rate is SORA-pegged.** Actual payment tracks SORA (~3.5% currently), not the 4.0% stress rate. Budget for the real rate, not the stress test.

