## SECTION 7 — RATE STRESS-TEST

Loan: $1,200,000 outstanding | 25 years remaining | SORA-pegged
Shock: **3.5% → 5.0% (+150bps)**

| Metric | 3.5% (current) | 5.0% (shocked) | Change |
